      "message": "The script that fetches the draft head, from Strata, in the repository\n\nthird_party/strata/mtp_fetch.py is Strata's tools/mtp_fetch.py (0.1.40.3), unchanged, with Strata's MIT license\nbeside it. It reads the 31 tensors of the draft head out of the 16-bit checkpoint by range requests and checks\neach against a SHA-256. Run from here it fetched one tensor whose hash is that of the copy fetched before.",
